       1.)  This notice shall not be removed.
       2.)  Credit shall not be taken for the creation of this source.
       3.)  This code is not to be traded, sold, or used for personal
            gain or profit.

The files main.c, init.c, play.c, level.c, room.c, move.c, hit.c, display.c,
message.c, message_data.c, invent.c, use.c, random.c, object.c, pack.c, monster.c,
rogue.h, and their
corresponding headers contain code or structures derived from the Rogue
sources.  Each such file retains the notice above.

Files whose names begin with "mz_" contain MZ-1500 platform support.  Their
separate implementation does not remove or replace the restrictions that
apply when this port is distributed as a Rogue-derived program.

Source code and executable images of this port must not be sold, traded, or
